cares provides a C++26 DNS resolver driven by uring::Proactor.
Configure consumers with CMake >= 4.0 and the required dependency packages.

    find_package(cares CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE cares::cares)

The umbrella header is <cares/cares.hpp>. ResolveEndpoints returns Result<EndpointList> by value.
The resolver arms io_uring POLL_ADD, POLL_REMOVE, and TIMEOUT operations. It does not call poll, select, or epoll_wait.
